{"id": "t115-001", "text": "Coffee with Simone and Lola. Simone's birthday is next Saturday and she's been going on about a new pair of climbing shoes, size 39. Lola's off to Lisbon on Thursday for a week. Remind me to text Lola the day before to ask if she wants a lift to the airport.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lola", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "going on about a new pair of climbing shoes", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "size 39", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lola", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Lisbon", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Lola", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lola", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-002", "text": "Jack's really into his Warhammer now, painting a whole Ultramarines army. He said the new paint set is too pricey for him. Could be a good one for his birthday in a fortnight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Warhammer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Ultramarines army", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new paint set", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t115-003", "text": "Errands: post office before it shuts Friday, pick up dry cleaning, renew car insurance by the 30th.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post office", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before it shuts Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick up dry cleaning", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "renew car insurance", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the 30th", "anchor": "a3"}]}
{"id": "t115-004", "text": "Rang Wei tonight. Her dad's 70th is this weekend and she's doing the whole cake herself, three tiers, bit stressed about it. Her brother Reza is flying in from Toronto on Friday. Should check in with her on Sunday to see how the party went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bit stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Toronto", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-005", "text": "Emil's band has a gig at the Lexington next Tuesday. He's nervous because it's their first one with the new drummer. Don't forget to send him good luck that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig at the Lexington", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-006", "text": "Bumped into Gemma at the market. Her daughter turns six on Wednesday and is obsessed with Bluey, everything has to be Bluey. Gemma's throwing a small party the Saturday after. I'm bringing the balloons.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns six", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Bluey", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "small party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t115-007", "text": "Jun's started knitting, mostly socks so far. Says it's the only thing that switches her brain off after work. Uses chunky merino and hates acrylic.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "knitting", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chunky merino", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates acrylic", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t115-008", "text": "Astrid said the book club's Friday meetup is called off, half of them have flu. Next one probably in a fortnight. She's reading the new Sally Rooney and not loving it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Astrid", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Next one", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t115-009", "text": "Long chat with Shanice. She's gutted, Arsenal lost again and she had money on it. Her partner Malik got season tickets for her birthday last year, so the bar's high this time. Her birthday's on the 14th. She mentioned wanting a signed shirt but that's way out of budget. Maybe a framed print of the Emirates? Must ask Malik what he's getting her so we don't double up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Arsenal", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a signed shirt", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "framed print of the Emirates", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Malik what he's getting her", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t115-010", "text": "Sadia's mum is in hospital for her knee op tomorrow. Sadia's taking the morning off to drive her in. Need to message Sadia the next day and see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Sadia", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-011", "text": "Antoine and his wife are celebrating their tenth anniversary Friday, dinner at the place by the canal. Their kids are staying with his sister.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tenth anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t115-012", "text": "Milan is training for the Brighton half in April, running four times a week. Knee's been playing up though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Brighton half", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "running", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Knee's been playing up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t115-013", "text": "Bao's dog Pepper had her operation on Monday and is wearing the cone of shame. Bao's been sleeping on the sofa next to her. Remind me to ask Bao how Pepper's doing at the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Bao how Pepper's doing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
