{"id": "t115-017", "text": "Caught up with Eva and Olivia over brunch. Eva's moving to Bristol at the end of the month, she's sad to leave but the job's too good. Olivia's helping her pack on Saturday. Eva wants a leaving do the Friday before but hasn't sorted a venue.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sad to leave", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Friday before", "anchor": "e3"}]}
