{"id": "t115-025", "text": "Malik's been laid off, found out yesterday. He's putting a brave face on but you can tell he's rattled. His wife's due in March so the timing is awful. Must call him this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "laid off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rattled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-026", "text": "Hamza said his gran's 90th is next Sunday, whole family going to Birmingham for lunch. He's doing a slideshow of old photos.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "90th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t115-027", "text": "Alfie's into retro gaming, has every Game Boy ever made apparently. Wants a Game Boy Color in the clear purple. Birthday in three weeks. Don't forget to check eBay.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "retro gaming", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has every Game Boy ever made", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wants a Game Boy Color in the clear purple", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check eBay", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t115-028", "text": "Simone said Lola's interview went brilliantly yesterday and they've already offered her the job! Starts in January. Need to send Lola a congrats card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lola", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered her the job", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starts", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Lola a congrats card", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lola", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t115-029", "text": "Jack and his partner Gemma are expecting! Due in May. They're both buzzing. Gemma's had awful morning sickness though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "buzzing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "morning sickness", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t115-030", "text": "Saw Wei at the climbing wall. She's moving up to the 6b routes now. Wants to do an outdoor trip to Fontainebleau next spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "outdoor trip to Fontainebleau", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t115-031", "text": "Quick one: Reza's exam results come out Thursday. Ask him how he did on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "exam results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how he did", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-032", "text": "Emil's grandma passed away on Sunday. Funeral's next Friday in Gdansk, he's flying out Wednesday. I'll mind his cat Biscuit while he's gone. Should send flowers to his mum before the funeral.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandma", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he's gone"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers to his mum", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the funeral", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-033", "text": "Jun and her husband are off to Japan for three weeks from Tuesday, first proper holiday since the baby. Her mum's coming with them to help.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Japan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t115-034", "text": "Astrid is a massive Tolkien nerd, reads the whole trilogy every winter. Has a first edition Hobbit she won't let anyone touch. Hates the films.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Astrid", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Tolkien", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Has a first edition Hobbit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Hates the films", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t115-035", "text": "Need to sort the car MOT this week. Also ring the council about the bins, they skipped us again.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort the car MOT", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring the council about the bins", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t115-036", "text": "Shanice told me her nan's turning 85 on the 2nd. They're doing afternoon tea at the Savoy the day after. She asked if I'd chip in for flowers, said yes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning 85", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "afternoon tea at the Savoy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t115-037", "text": "Sadia had a scan on Tuesday, all fine. She'd been worrying for weeks but it's all clear now. Her husband took her out for dinner that evening to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t115-038", "text": "Antoine is obsessed with sourdough, has a starter called Gerald he feeds twice a day. Brought me a loaf, it was incredible.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sourdough", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a starter called Gerald", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t115-039", "text": "Milan's sister Zara is getting married in June, the hen do is in Ibiza the weekend before. Milan's not invited obviously but he's organising the stag for her fiance Carlos. Big pressure, he's been stressing about it all week. Remind me to ask Milan on Monday if he's booked the paintball.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen do", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stag", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fiance", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carlos", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Milan", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-040", "text": "Lunch with Bao, Noah and Eva. Bao's just finished his MA, graduation's on the 18th. Noah's got a new puppy, a cockapoo called Rolo, and is completely sleep deprived. Eva's training for a triathlon in a fortnight and is swimming every morning. Nice to see them all.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MA", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new puppy, a cockapoo called Rolo", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sleep deprived", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "triathlon", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "swimming", "owner": "p3"}]}
{"id": "t115-041", "text": "Olivia's play opens next Thursday, she's got the lead. Opening night jitters already. I've got tickets for the Saturday. Should send her a good luck text the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "play", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Opening night jitters", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a good luck text", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-042", "text": "Sam said Aaliyah is applying to the Royal College of Music, audition is on the 12th. She plays violin, been at it since she was four. She's pretty calm about it apparently.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aaliyah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applying to the Royal College of Music", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "violin", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty calm", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t115-043", "text": "Andre's dad has started chemo. Andre's going down to see him every weekend. He's exhausted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chemo", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t115-044", "text": "Weekend plan: Saturday clear out the shed, Sunday farmers market and then finally finish the jigsaw.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "clear out the shed", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "farmers market", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "finish the jigsaw", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t115-045", "text": "Catalina loves board games, especially the long strategy ones like Twilight Imperium. Her birthday's next Friday. She dropped a hint about the new expansion.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Catalina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "board games", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Twilight Imperium", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropped a hint about the new expansion", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t115-046", "text": "Talked to Nasser on the phone. His daughter Mai has her GCSE mocks the week after half term and he's worried she's not revising. He's coaching her five a side team on Saturdays too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSE mocks", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after half term", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "coaching her five a side team", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t115-047", "text": "Naledi and Aisha are doing a pottery course on Wednesday nights. Aisha made a wonky mug she's weirdly proud of.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "weirdly proud", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t115-048", "text": "Malik's wife had the baby! Little girl, Amira, born Saturday morning. Remind me to drop off a meal for them next week and get a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Little girl", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amira", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off a meal for them", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t115-049", "text": "Hamza's leaving drinks are Friday at the Crown, he's off to a new job in Manchester. Starts the Monday after. I should ask him how the first week went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job in Manchester", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Monday after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how the first week went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t115-050", "text": "Alfie's mum is having her hip done next Tuesday. He's taking the week off to look after her. Check in with him midweek.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her hip done", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "midweek", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-051", "text": "Simone plays bass in a ska band, gigs every couple of months. Next one's at the Dublin Castle on Saturday. Her boyfriend Jack does the sound.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bass", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ska band", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Next one", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "does the sound", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t115-052", "text": "Gemma's Uncle Reza is retiring after thirty years at the post office. Party is next Saturday. She's making a photo book. Must give her the photos from the summer before Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Reza", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Party", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "give her the photos from the summer", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-053", "text": "Pick up prescription, sort out the gas bill and get Mum's present wrapped before Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pick up prescription", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort out the gas bill", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get Mum's present wrapped", "owner": "r1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Sunday", "anchor": "a3"}]}
{"id": "t115-054", "text": "Wei mentioned her son Jun is into Pokémon cards in a big way, trading at school every lunchtime. His birthday's on the 3rd. Booster box could work.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Pokémon cards", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Booster box could work", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t115-055", "text": "Lola said Astrid failed her theory test again yesterday, she's really down about it. Retake is in a fortnight. Remind me to message Astrid tomorrow to see how she's doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lola", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Astrid", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "theory test", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "down", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Retake", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Astrid", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Astrid", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-056", "text": "Dinner with Shanice and her sister Olivia. Olivia's just got engaged to her girlfriend, they're planning a small wedding next autumn. Shanice is already planning the hen. Their parents are thrilled. Olivia's also in the middle of buying a flat in Leith, completion should be in a fortnight. Need to send Olivia congrats and maybe something for the new flat.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got engaged", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "small wedding", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next autumn", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "buying a flat in Leith", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "completion", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Olivia congrats", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "something for the new flat", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e5", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t115-057", "text": "Emil's gone vegetarian, says it's for the climate. Still eats fish though so not sure what that makes him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eats fish", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
